    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24597" root="صقع" body-key="S">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصقع</span></b>  <i>He</i> (a man, O, TA) <i>entered upon</i> [<i>a
time,</i> or <i>a tract, of</i>] <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَقِيع</span> [i. e. <i>hoar-frost,</i> or
<i>rime</i>]. (IDrd, O, K, TA.) ＝   
    <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer1"> </span>-A2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اصقع الصَّقِيعُ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الأَرْضَ</span>, (K, TA,) and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">الشَّجَرَ</span>, (O, TA,) <i>The</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صقيع</span>
[or <i>hoar-frost</i>] <i>fell,</i> or <i>lighted, upon the earth,</i> or
<i>ground,</i> (K, * TA,) and <i>the trees.</i> (O, TA.) And
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُصْقِعَتِ الأَرْضُ</span>: see 1, last sentence. And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أُصْقِعَ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">النَّاسُ</span> <i>The men,</i> or <i>people, became overspread
with the</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">صَقِيع</span>. (TA.)

